1
00:00:01,621 --> 00:00:04,727
The Invisible Challenger

2
00:00:08,156 --> 00:00:09,830
Pass it here!

3
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:17,454
Not bad.

4
00:00:17,655 --> 00:00:18,617
Go, Jun!

5
00:00:18,617 --> 00:00:19,591
You can do it!

6
00:00:24,239 --> 00:00:25,347
Goal!

7
00:00:25,347 --> 00:00:27,297
Haha! How d'ya like that?

8
00:00:27,297 --> 00:00:28,544
Jun!

9
00:00:29,986 --> 00:00:31,888
What the...?

10
00:00:33,609 --> 00:00:34,871
Augh!

11
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:39,118
Jun, are you alright?

12
00:00:40,216 --> 00:00:44,256
Ugh... what just happened?

13
00:00:46,197 --> 00:00:47,969
Okay, bye!

14
00:00:47,969 --> 00:00:50,131
Anna! See you tomorrow!

15
00:00:58,582 --> 00:00:59,554
Jun?

16
00:01:00,996 --> 00:01:03,097
You should watch where you're going.

17
00:01:05,212 --> 00:01:06,628
W-What was that?

18
00:01:12,825 --> 00:01:14,045
What just happened?

19
00:01:14,444 --> 00:01:17,777
I don't understand what's going on today...

20
00:01:20,412 --> 00:01:21,442
Augh!

21
00:01:22,971 --> 00:01:25,286
What is up with me today?!

22
00:01:26,197 --> 00:01:29,670
Haha! It looks like you're having a bad luck day.

23
00:01:29,670 --> 00:01:32,628
No, it's not just some bad luck.

24
00:01:32,628 --> 00:01:36,682
I'm sure someone must have put a curse on me!

25
00:01:36,682 --> 00:01:38,045
And who would do that?

26
00:01:38,045 --> 00:01:40,710
I wish I knew so I could get my hands on them!

27
00:01:46,277 --> 00:01:48,087
What are you guys going on about?

28
00:01:48,929 --> 00:01:51,591
Haha!

29
00:01:51,591 --> 00:01:53,478
What's all over your face?!

30
00:01:54,257 --> 00:01:55,859
What's wrong with your face?

31
00:01:55,859 --> 00:01:58,036
You're one to talk! Have you looked in a mirror?

32
00:01:58,036 --> 00:01:59,799
I would say it's an improvement.

33
00:01:59,799 --> 00:02:00,608
What did you say?!

34
00:02:00,608 --> 00:02:01,983
It was you, wasn't it?!

35
00:02:01,983 --> 00:02:03,894
Alright, settle down!

36
00:02:04,295 --> 00:02:05,881
What are you all up to?

37
00:02:10,544 --> 00:02:12,978
We all got pranked real bad.

38
00:02:12,978 --> 00:02:15,120
Who could have pulled such a prank?

39
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:16,341
I don't know...

40
00:02:16,341 --> 00:02:20,109
I was just sunbathing in the area while you were at school.

41
00:02:20,109 --> 00:02:23,680
We can get rusty if we just stay in our Metal Card forms.

42
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:27,275
When I woke up, this had happened.

43
00:02:27,275 --> 00:02:29,675
Did kids in the neighborhood scribble on them?

44
00:02:31,575 --> 00:02:34,283
It does seem like a childish prank.

45
00:02:34,283 --> 00:02:35,843
Who are you calling childish?!

46
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:37,800
Who's there?!

47
00:02:41,627 --> 00:02:42,800
What was that?!

48
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,194
Is it invisible?

49
00:02:45,694 --> 00:02:47,143
What? What's going on?

50
00:02:47,143 --> 00:02:48,533
Haha!

51
00:02:50,621 --> 00:02:51,675
Show yourself!

52
00:02:52,175 --> 00:02:54,069
You must be a Metal Cardbot like us!

53
00:02:54,370 --> 00:02:56,908
Heh! So you figured out, huh?

54
00:02:56,908 --> 00:02:59,211
Stealth mode, off!

55
00:03:01,239 --> 00:03:02,491
Is it a helicopter?

56
00:03:02,491 --> 00:03:05,867
No, it's a VTOL aircraft. Vertical Take-Off and Landing.

57
00:03:05,867 --> 00:03:08,562
They were camouflaged to blend into their surroundings!

58
00:03:08,562 --> 00:03:10,384
I think there was something else like that on Earth. Looks kinda like a lizard...

59
00:03:10,384 --> 00:03:13,294
Chameleon.

60
00:03:13,294 --> 00:03:14,265
Yeah, that's it.

61
00:03:14,265 --> 00:03:16,651
Hey, chameleon helicopter!

62
00:03:16,651 --> 00:03:18,006
Who are you?

63
00:03:18,949 --> 00:03:20,989
You can call me Shadow X.

64
00:03:21,187 --> 00:03:23,111
You drew on their faces, didn't you?!

65
00:03:23,111 --> 00:03:25,360
Yeah, and that's not all!

66
00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:27,568
I was also the one pranking you all day long!

67
00:03:36,781 --> 00:03:38,276
So that was all you!

68
00:03:38,276 --> 00:03:39,750
Why are you pulling pranks on everyone?

69
00:03:39,750 --> 00:03:41,288
Isn't it obvious?

70
00:03:41,288 --> 00:03:42,319
I. Just.

71
00:03:42,319 --> 00:03:42,884
Don't.

72
00:03:42,884 --> 00:03:43,263
Like.

73
00:03:43,263 --> 00:03:44,473
You!

74
00:03:44,473 --> 00:03:45,716
But what do you mean?

75
00:03:45,716 --> 00:03:47,473
What have I ever done to you?

76
00:03:47,473 --> 00:03:49,256
What did you do, Jun?

77
00:03:49,256 --> 00:03:51,175
Try to remember what it was.

78
00:03:51,175 --> 00:03:53,980
I didn't do anything! Hrgh...

79
00:03:53,980 --> 00:03:55,700
That's it! The Metal Breath!

80
00:03:56,800 --> 00:04:01,467
You're using that to seal and summon all of us Metal Cardbots,

81
00:04:01,467 --> 00:04:03,770
like you're the boss around here or something!

82
00:04:03,770 --> 00:04:05,318
I did no such thing!

83
00:04:05,318 --> 00:04:07,943
The Metal Breath is the sign of the chosen one,

84
00:04:07,943 --> 00:04:09,598
the one who will lead us.

85
00:04:09,598 --> 00:04:13,513
We need it and Jun to coexist peacefully on planet Earth.

86
00:04:13,513 --> 00:04:14,295
Hmph!

87
00:04:14,295 --> 00:04:17,286
I refuse to submit to some goofy kid.

88
00:04:17,286 --> 00:04:20,192
I want to fly high in the sky and be free!

89
00:04:20,192 --> 00:04:23,081
Hey, don't call me a goofy kid, you chameleon helicopter!

90
00:04:23,081 --> 00:04:25,560
I said my name is Shadow X!

91
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:28,336
Yeah?! Well, that's a stupid name for a plane!

92
00:04:28,336 --> 00:04:29,735
What did you say, you little runt?!

93
00:04:32,274 --> 00:04:34,430
It's an acorn measuring contest.

94
00:04:34,430 --> 00:04:35,944
They must both be five years old.

95
00:04:36,533 --> 00:04:38,042
You want to have it your way?

96
00:04:38,042 --> 00:04:39,968
Then just try and seal me!

97
00:04:39,968 --> 00:04:42,319
Only then will I be your underling!

98
00:04:42,319 --> 00:04:44,786
Like those other chumps you got there!

99
00:04:45,545 --> 00:04:48,423
Ugh, here we go again. Another troublesome robot appears.

100
00:04:48,423 --> 00:04:49,973
Blue Cop! Let's go after him!

101
00:04:49,973 --> 00:04:50,973
Roger!

102
00:04:51,375 --> 00:04:55,598
How do you plan to catch a plane that can fly and become invisible?!

103
00:04:57,665 --> 00:04:58,764
Hey, guys!

104
00:04:59,264 --> 00:05:02,396
I'll show that helicopter what we're made of!

105
00:05:16,158 --> 00:05:18,117
Oh, I'm sorry!

106
00:05:18,221 --> 00:05:20,314
Stop, stop, you guys!

107
00:05:20,314 --> 00:05:22,947
Where's your energy?! I need you committed on this!

108
00:05:22,947 --> 00:05:24,411
Sorry, Vera...

109
00:05:24,411 --> 00:05:28,129
My dance videos haven't been getting views at all lately!

110
00:05:28,129 --> 00:05:30,449
Can't you put some passion into it?!

111
00:05:30,449 --> 00:05:31,704
Yeah, sure...

112
00:05:33,187 --> 00:05:34,394
It's the police!

113
00:05:34,394 --> 00:05:37,545
We aren't allowed to be here! Let's get out of here before we get in trouble!

114
00:05:37,545 --> 00:05:40,175
Hang on. Something doesn't seem right.

115
00:05:40,175 --> 00:05:41,810
Hey! Vera!

116
00:05:47,100 --> 00:05:48,816
He's going up towards the cranes!

117
00:05:51,389 --> 00:05:54,360
First, we'll need to get Shadow X to come down!

118
00:05:55,980 --> 00:05:58,920
Ha! Took you long enough to get here!

119
00:05:58,920 --> 00:06:01,552
You're so slow! I was getting bored!

120
00:06:01,552 --> 00:06:02,778
This guy...

121
00:06:02,778 --> 00:06:04,336
Blue Cop! Prepare for battle!

122
00:06:04,336 --> 00:06:05,151
Alright.

123
00:06:10,148 --> 00:06:12,151
Metal Cardbot, pickup!

124
00:06:14,687 --> 00:06:16,543
Blue Cop, setup!

125
00:06:37,812 --> 00:06:40,954
I really hate how you act like such a show-off, ordering everyone around like that.

126
00:06:40,954 --> 00:06:42,798
Like, you call the shots around here!

127
00:06:42,798 --> 00:06:44,841
What did I do to make you so upset?

128
00:06:44,841 --> 00:06:47,369
Enough talk, you blue-haired runt!

129
00:06:50,228 --> 00:06:52,115
Spinning Cutter!

130
00:06:53,947 --> 00:06:54,887
It's a shuriken!

131
00:06:54,887 --> 00:06:56,973
Blue Cop! Burst Shot!

132
00:07:02,290 --> 00:07:03,624
Way to go, Blue Cop!

133
00:07:03,624 --> 00:07:04,971
One more shot!

134
00:07:05,821 --> 00:07:07,374
Stealth mode, on!

135
00:07:09,122 --> 00:07:10,399
Where did he go?

136
00:07:10,399 --> 00:07:12,639
He's more like a ninja than a chameleon.

137
00:07:13,197 --> 00:07:15,018
Where did he go?

138
00:07:16,259 --> 00:07:18,120
Haha! Yaah!

139
00:07:20,612 --> 00:07:24,778
Oooh, look out! Don't take your eyes off me, now! Hah!

140
00:07:25,422 --> 00:07:27,297
That kid over there, is that Jun?

141
00:07:27,297 --> 00:07:28,095
I think it is!

142
00:07:28,095 --> 00:07:29,648
And isn't that Theo over there too?

143
00:07:29,648 --> 00:07:32,899
But what's that robot doing? Some kind of weird dance?

144
00:07:32,899 --> 00:07:34,471
Quick, take a video!

145
00:07:34,471 --> 00:07:35,668
Alright!

146
00:07:36,487 --> 00:07:39,281
This is sure to get me some views!

147
00:07:41,262 --> 00:07:45,543
Hahaha! Why don't you watch where you're going?

148
00:07:55,314 --> 00:07:56,781
Blue Cop!

149
00:08:05,701 --> 00:08:07,427
Megabolt...

150
00:08:08,127 --> 00:08:10,149
Punch!

151
00:08:12,403 --> 00:08:13,737
Aah!

152
00:08:16,108 --> 00:08:18,663
I don't get it. How did you know where I was?!

153
00:08:18,663 --> 00:08:22,112
You can only hide yourself by blending into your surroundings.

154
00:08:22,112 --> 00:08:24,649
But it looks like you can't hide your shadow!

155
00:08:25,850 --> 00:08:29,728
Don't think you've already won! Stealth mode, on!

156
00:08:32,099 --> 00:08:33,898
Huh...? Uh-oh!

157
00:08:34,369 --> 00:08:37,619
Blue Cop! Thunderbolt Smash!

158
00:08:38,480 --> 00:08:41,072
Thunderbolt...

159
00:08:41,072 --> 00:08:42,927
Smash!

160
00:08:46,961 --> 00:08:47,786
What is this?!

161
00:08:52,514 --> 00:08:53,835
What's with this wind??

162
00:08:53,835 --> 00:08:55,822
Oh no, my phone!

163
00:08:56,274 --> 00:08:57,153
Watch out!

164
00:09:00,989 --> 00:09:02,307
Haha!

165
00:09:03,562 --> 00:09:05,326
Blue Cop! Are you alright?

166
00:09:05,326 --> 00:09:06,658
Yeah, I'm okay.

167
00:09:06,658 --> 00:09:10,317
Hey hey! Don't push yourself too hard.

168
00:09:10,317 --> 00:09:12,181
I think we should switch out, Jun!

169
00:09:12,181 --> 00:09:15,676
I won't give you the chance! Heli-Tornado!

170
00:09:16,475 --> 00:09:17,373
Jun!

171
00:09:20,350 --> 00:09:21,461
Blue Cop!

172
00:09:21,461 --> 00:09:23,067
Don't worry!

173
00:09:23,067 --> 00:09:25,349
How long do you think you can keep that up?

174
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:35,517
Blue Cop!

175
00:09:37,735 --> 00:09:38,984
Haha!

176
00:09:40,283 --> 00:09:42,831
Looks like I won, blue-haired kid!

177
00:09:42,831 --> 00:09:46,418
Too bad! Looks like I won't become one of your underlings.

178
00:09:46,418 --> 00:09:48,985
You keep saying underling...

179
00:09:48,985 --> 00:09:52,206
but I have never made any Metal Cardbot my underling!

180
00:09:52,206 --> 00:09:56,606
After acting so high and mighty, I don't need your excuses!

181
00:09:56,606 --> 00:10:01,177
Well, what do you have to say? Is this kid your boss or what?

182
00:10:01,375 --> 00:10:03,706
Jun, to us Metal Cardbots, is our...

183
00:10:03,807 --> 00:10:04,889
Friend!

184
00:10:06,490 --> 00:10:07,879
...A...friend?!

185
00:10:09,181 --> 00:10:11,668
I don't get it! What are you talking about?

186
00:10:12,370 --> 00:10:14,240
If you don't know, I'll tell you!

187
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:16,182
But only if you can defeat us!

188
00:10:16,182 --> 00:10:17,286
What?

189
00:10:17,687 --> 00:10:19,767
Let's have a rematch, Shadow X!

190
00:10:19,767 --> 00:10:22,144
I promise I will seal you for sure!

191
00:10:23,980 --> 00:10:27,379
Next time we meet, I'll be sure to blow you away with my Heli-Tornado!

192
00:10:27,379 --> 00:10:31,091
That's what you think. But I have a secret weapon that can beat your Heli-Tornado!

193
00:10:31,091 --> 00:10:33,211
Huh? A secret weapon?!

194
00:10:36,955 --> 00:10:39,296
I-I accept your challenge!

195
00:10:39,296 --> 00:10:41,634
Next time we meet, we will see if your secret weapon

196
00:10:41,634 --> 00:10:43,990
can beat my Heli-Tornado!

197
00:10:43,990 --> 00:10:47,379
I'm not leaving because I'm scared of some "secret weapon" or anything.

198
00:10:47,379 --> 00:10:49,504
D-Don't take this the wrong way!

199
00:10:52,937 --> 00:10:53,619
Jun!

200
00:10:53,619 --> 00:10:55,215
Are you alright?

201
00:10:55,715 --> 00:10:57,865
What is this secret weapon?

202
00:10:58,466 --> 00:11:00,514
I would also like to know what it is.

203
00:11:00,514 --> 00:11:03,450
Ah, about that...

